# The Cuco's bartender (workstream CUCOS, Nov 3 2026; design/godot-cucos.md). 1995.
# The coupon lines are Steven's. His name is a PLACEHOLDER, and so is the gift line.
# Without the coupon in the hand he doesn't use this file: the shop opens instead
# (mall.shop.open("cucos"), data/story/shops.json "cucos", whose greeting is his first line).
#
# Flags (mall.flags, saved): cu_coupon_used (the coupon is spent), cu_doubloon_given (the doubloon is
# handed over once only).

~ start
if holding cu_coupon
	PLACEHOLDER Bartender: Oh, wow, you have a top-shelf margarita coupon. That's great. Let me get that for you.
	take cu_coupon
	set cu_coupon_used = true
	PLACEHOLDER Bartender: Here you go.
	give cu_topshelf
	if not cu_doubloon_given
		set cu_doubloon_given = true
		PLACEHOLDER Bartender: PLACEHOLDER (he gives you a Cuco's Mardi Gras doubloon too, as a gift; Steven to write the line)
		give cu_doubloon
	=> END
=> END
